OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOccasional patchy light rain,
OL,6,Fmost persistent across Argyll. Rather
OL,7,Fcloudy with best of any limited
OL,8,Fbrighter spells expected early morning
OL,9,Fand east of Glasgow. South to
OL,10,Fsoutheast winds occasionally brisk
OL,11,Faround the coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain turning heavy by
OL,14,Flate evening, then clearing to only a
OL,15,Ffew light showers overnight. Brisk
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds easing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
