OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA mix of scattered showers
OL,6,Fand brighter spells during the
OL,7,Fmorning. Outbreaks building for the
OL,8,Fafternoon, bringing the risk of
OL,9,Fthunderstorms to Argyll late
OL,10,Fafternoon. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday very windy with occasional
OL,14,Frain, which turns heavy at times. Rain
OL,15,Fearly Thursday, clearing to leave
OL,16,Fshowers and brighter spells from late
OL,17,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
